From: claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 23:04:37 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/5] failover: prepare every replica to follow every peer that
 can be promoted

cluster-3 now holds an externalClusters entry, the replication
certificate, the ca and a read only key for cluster-2, and the netpols
allow the stream, so the deciders repoint after a failover is one field
instead of a page. add-replica pairs the new replica with the primary
and every live replica, and every existing replica with the new one.}" && \
git add failover-controller/decider tenant-workload/failover/monitoring.yaml && \
git $C commit -q -m "failover: page when a primary has no live replica or the checker holds failover${T/#/

a halt stays fail closed when the checker dies or errors, and is now
paged after 10 minutes from the deciders own reading of it.

